ojection\": \"original AI occurrence\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"conv_8487ad8077f4:msg_32\",\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": \"编号已经干净了，但还有一个细节：整篇文档的编号是连续递增的（1-15），正式文档里分节重新编号更规范。我调整成每节独立编号。\",\n      \"source_message_ids\": [\n        \"conv_8487ad8077f4:msg_32\"\n      ],\n      \"user_created_at\": null,\n      \"projection\": \"original AI occurrence\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"conv_8487ad8077f4:msg_36\",\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": \"替换逻辑搞反了位置，编号全乱了。我重写这段逻辑，按出现顺序重新分组分配。\",\n      \"source_message_ids\": [\n        \"conv_8487ad8077f4:msg_36\"\n      ],\n      \"user_created_at\": null,\n      \"projection\": \"original AI occurrence\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"conv_8487ad8077f4:msg_38\",\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": \"编号全部正确了。最后转成PDF预览一下排版效果，确认表格和页面没问题。\",\n      \"source_message_ids\": [\n        \"conv_8487ad8077f4:msg_38\"\n      ],\n      \"user_created_at\": null,\n      \"projection\": \"original AI occurrence\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"conv_8487ad8077f4:msg_40\",\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": \"发现行动清单的编号可能有问题，检查一下当前脚本里那部分的实际状态。\",\n      \"source_message_ids\": [\n        \"conv_8487ad8077f4:msg_40\"\n      ],\n      \"user_created_at\": null,\n      \"projection\": \"original AI occurrence\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"conv_8487ad8077f4:msg_42\",\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": \"代码层面没问题（forEach 运行时生成6条）。验证一下最新文档里行动清单的实际编号，并看PDF排版效果。\",\n      \"source_message_ids\": [\n        \"conv_8487ad8077f4:msg_42\"\n      ],\n      \"user_created_at\": null,\n      \"projection\": \"original AI occurrence\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"conv_8487ad8077f4:msg_44\",\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": \"pandoc 对编号的提取不稳定，直接看 PDF 渲染图确认最终效果。\",\n      \"source_message_ids\": [\n        \"conv_8487ad8077f4:msg_44\"\n      ],\n      \"user_created_at\": null,\n      \"projection\": \"original AI occurrence\"\n    },\